### 58. 查询可派遣车辆：自动保存第一辆车辆ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicles?status=AVAILABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% client.global.set("vehicleId", response.body.data[0].id); %}

### 59. 查询可派遣司机：自动保存第一名司机ID；不返回敏感信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-drivers?status=AVAILABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% client.global.set("driverId", response.body.data[0].id); %}

### 60. 管理员派车：系统校验车辆时段冲突、车辆座位数和司机状态
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-applications/{{vehicleApplicationId}}/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{vehicleId}},
  "driverId": {{driverId}}
}

> {% client.global.set("dispatchId", response.body.data.dispatchId); %}

### 61. 管理员代操作司机接单：仅用于管理端应急处理
# 正常履约应使用 /api/v1/app/driver/tasks/{dispatchId}/accept
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-dispatches/{{dispatchId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 62. 司机出车
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-dispatches/{{dispatchId}}/depart
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 63. 完成行程：车辆和司机恢复为可用状态，并写入里程与油耗日志
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-dispatches/{{dispatchId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "endMileageKm": 12920.5,
  "fuelLiter": 8.3,
  "remark": "已安全返回，车辆状况正常"
}

### 64. 用户查询自己的内部用车申请及当前状态
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-applications/{{vehicleApplicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 65. 查询社会租赁车型：自动保存第一个车型ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-rentals/models
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

> {% client.global.set("rentalModelId", response.body.data[0].modelId); %}

### 66. 查询社会租赁报价：返回可用车辆数、租金、押金和应付总额
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-rentals/quote?modelId={{rentalModelId}}&rentalMode=HALF_DAY&startAt=2026-08-15T08:00:00&endAt=2026-08-15T12:00:00&passengerCount=3&estimatedKm=80
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 67. 创建社会租赁待支付订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: vehicle-rental-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": {{rentalModelId}},
  "rentalMode": "HALF_DAY",
  "startAt": "2026-08-15T08:00:00",
  "endAt": "2026-08-15T12:00:00",
  "departure": "包头市区",
  "destination": "示例景区",
  "passengerCount": 3,
  "estimatedKm": 80,
  "remark": "社会租赁联调订单"
}

> {% client.global.set("vehicleRentalOrderId", response.body.data.orderId); %}

### 68. 查询我的社会租赁订单：新订单状态应为 PENDING_PAYMENT
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 69. 模拟支付社会租赁订单：支付金额包含租金和押金
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/orders/{{vehicleRentalOrderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: vehicle-rental-payment-{{$timestamp}}

### 70. 管理员查询本次社会租赁车型的可派车辆
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicles?status=AVAILABLE&modelId={{rentalModelId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% client.global.set("rentalVehicleId", response.body.data[0].id); %}

### 71. 管理员查询可派司机
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-drivers?status=AVAILABLE
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% client.global.set("rentalDriverId", response.body.data[0].id); %}

### 72. 为已支付的社会租赁订单派车：仅可选择同车型车辆
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-rentals/{{vehicleRentalOrderId}}/dispatch
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{rentalVehicleId}},
  "driverId": {{rentalDriverId}}
}

> {% client.global.set("rentalDispatchId", response.body.data.dispatchId); %}

### 73. 社会租赁司机接单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-rental-dispatches/{{rentalDispatchId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 74. 社会租赁车辆出发
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-rental-dispatches/{{rentalDispatchId}}/depart
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 75. 社会租赁车辆位置上报：正式接入GPS后由设备平台调用，目前用于人工联调
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-dispatches/{{rentalDispatchId}}/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "longitude": 109.8403,
  "latitude": 40.6574,
  "mileageKm": 13035.5,
  "eventAt": "2026-08-15T10:20:00",
  "remark": "车辆行驶至示例景区附近"
}

### 76. 查询社会租赁行程轨迹和状态日志
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-dispatches/{{rentalDispatchId}}/trip-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 77. 社会租赁还车结算：计算超时费、超公里费、押金抵扣、押金退款和待补款金额
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-rental-dispatches/{{rentalDispatchId}}/return
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "returnedAt": "2026-08-15T14:30:00",
  "endMileageKm": 13100.0,
  "fuelLiter": 10.5,
  "condition": "客户已还车，车况正常",
  "photoUrls": [
    "/images/vehicle-handover/front.jpg",
    "/images/vehicle-handover/mileage.jpg"
  ]
}

### 78. 用户查看本次租赁的结算、押金抵扣与退款结果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-rentals/{{vehicleRentalOrderId}}/settlement
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 80. 管理员查询全部社会租赁订单；可将状态改为 PAID、IN_SERVICE 或 COMPLETED
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-rentals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 81. 查询车辆运营统计报表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-reports/overview?startDate=2026-08-01&endDate=2026-08-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 82. 导出车辆运营CSV报表：IDEA会将响应保存为CSV内容
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-reports/export?startDate=2026-08-01&endDate=2026-08-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 83. 打开可打印的车辆运营报表：响应为HTML，可在浏览器中打印为PDF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-reports/print?startDate=2026-08-01&endDate=2026-08-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 84. 管理员新增社会租赁车型：车型编码创建后不可修改
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-models
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelCode": "EV_BUS_{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "新能源商务车",
  "seatCount": 7,
  "fuelType": "ELECTRIC",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

> {% client.global.set("newVehicleModelId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 85. 为新车型配置租赁价格：完成后车型会自动出现在用户端车型列表
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-models/{{newVehicleModelId}}/tariff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "halfDayCent": 36000,
  "fullDayCent": 60000,
  "monthCent": 880000,
  "bareMonthCent": 680000,
  "overtimeCentPerHour": 8000,
  "overDistanceCentPerKm": 300,
  "enabled": true
}

### 86. 管理员新增一辆实体车辆：configuration必须是合法的JSON字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelId": {{newVehicleModelId}},
  "vehicleNo": "EV-{{$timestamp}}",
  "plateNo": "蒙A{{$timestamp}}",
  "imageUrl": "/images/vehicles/ev-business.jpg",
  "configuration": "{\"color\":\"白色\",\"gps\":true,\"airConditioner\":true}",
  "status": "AVAILABLE",
  "mileageKm": 0
}

> {% client.global.set("newVehicleId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 87. 管理员新增司机：姓名、手机号和驾驶证号会加密保存
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-drivers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driverNo": "DRIVER-{{$timestamp}}",
  "name": "联调司机",
  "mobile": "13800138000",
  "licenseNo": "LICENSE-{{$timestamp}}",
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 88. 设置车辆不可租时段：用于维修、保养、年检和人工锁车
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicles/{{newVehicleId}}/unavailable-periods
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2026-09-10T08:00:00",
  "endAt": "2026-09-10T18:00:00",
  "reason": "计划保养"
}

> {% client.global.set("unavailablePeriodId", response.body.data.id); %}

### 89. 查询该车辆全部不可租时段
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicles/{{newVehicleId}}/unavailable-periods
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 90. 取消不可租时段
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/vehicle-unavailable-periods/{{unavailablePeriodId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 91. 用户查看指定车型的车辆图片、配置、状态和里程
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/vehicle-rentals/models/{{newVehicleModelId}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

